cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WorX in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "WorX: generate Notion Worker tools from OpenAPI specs"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Amit
    family-names: Kumar
    alias: growthperclick
    website: "https://iamamitkumar.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RavenRepo/notion-workx"
url: "https://ravenrepo.github.io/notion-workx/"
abstract: >-
  WorX reads an OpenAPI 3.x specification from a URL or file and generates a
  deployable Notion Worker project in TypeScript, in which every supported
  endpoint becomes a worker.tool() callable by Notion AI agents.
keywords:
  - Notion Workers
  - OpenAPI
  - code generation
  - TypeScript
  - AI agents
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
